    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Prison Survival: Architect of Crime Simulator is a sequel to the warmly received Prison Simulator, but with an unusual twist - you're no longer a prison guard. You are the<strong> prisoner</strong>!<br>Life in prison as a guard is hard, but as a prisoner - it's a whole different story.<br>Want to make money? Want a weapon? Want respect? Earn it - steal, make drugs, sell them, make deals with the guards, help with the prison tasks - whatever suits you, prepare for hardships you have never seen before!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><br>-Craft your own drugs, smuggle and sell them, trade with various characters and make your own network of business partners.<br><br><br><br>-Get into various prisoner chores: work in the workshop, sort the packages, cook in the kitchen, clean the rooms and don't forget about the toilets! But in the meantime you can expand your business!<br><br><br><br>-Prisoners have lots of free time on their hands - try to learn something, meet the right people, make friends, who will help you at the toughest of times, and enemies, who will make your life miserable.<br><br><br><br>-Make a deals with the guards or join the gang! You need this to survive!<br><br><br><br>-Get a cool unique tattoos! Stylish!<br><br><br><br>-Free the prisoners, bribe the guards, start a riot, overwhelm the other gangs and build your own prison empire!<br>Let the others fear you, as the King of the Prison!",
    "about_the_game": "Prison Survival: Architect of Crime Simulator is a sequel to the warmly received Prison Simulator, but with an unusual twist - you're no longer a prison guard. You are the<strong> prisoner</strong>!<br>Life in prison as a guard is hard, but as a prisoner - it's a whole different story.<br>Want to make money? Want a weapon? Want respect? Earn it - steal, make drugs, sell them, make deals with the guards, help with the prison tasks - whatever suits you, prepare for hardships you have never seen before!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><br>-Craft your own drugs, smuggle and sell them, trade with various characters and make your own network of business partners.<br><br><br><br>-Get into various prisoner chores: work in the workshop, sort the packages, cook in the kitchen, clean the rooms and don't forget about the toilets! But in the meantime you can expand your business!<br><br><br><br>-Prisoners have lots of free time on their hands - try to learn something, meet the right people, make friends, who will help you at the toughest of times, and enemies, who will make your life miserable.<br><br><br><br>-Make a deals with the guards or join the gang! You need this to survive!<br><br><br><br>-Get a cool unique tattoos! Stylish!<br><br><br><br>-Free the prisoners, bribe the guards, start a riot, overwhelm the other gangs and build your own prison empire!<br>Let the others fear you, as the King of the Prison!",
